## calendar_lookup Tool
Tool Specification:
```
{
   "name": "calendar_lookup",
   "description": "This tool can retrieve information about the user's personal calendar events. Maps from hw_calendar tool with action='retrieve' only.",
   "parameters": {
      "search_query": {
         "type": "string",
         "description": "query to search about, e.g. key info to look for, including topic, location, attendee or organizer of the calendar event.
-- If the user query is not about any specific topic/location/attendee/organizer, keep search_query null.
-- search_query cannot be just one word `calendar`, `meeting`, `event`, `appointment`, `plan`, `schedule`, or `agenda`, since it doesn't help to provide any real info, in which case keep it as null.",
         "required": false
      },
      "search_datetime": {
         "type": "string",
         "description": "timeframe to search the calendar around (e.g. last week, yesterday, today, tomorrow morning, around 9 am, next december, this month).
-- If no datetime range of interest is mentioned by the user, keep search_datetime `none`.",
         "required": false
      },
      "search_location": {
         "type": "string",
         "description": "location of the calendar event to search about (e.g. New York City, Sheraton, Starbucks, Tacoma office).
-- If no location is mentioned by the user, keep search_location `none`.",
         "required": false
      },
      "participants": {
         "type": "string",
         "description": "participants of the calendar event to search about, including organizer or attendee (e.g. Amy, my uncle, plumber, doctor).
-- If no participants is mentioned by the user, keep participants `none`.",
         "required": false
      },
      "search_availability": {
         "type": "string",
         "description": "is a boolean indicating if user wants to search for available/free slot, default to false.
-- If user asks 'am I free/available today', it is similar to asking for calendar events, search_availability should be false.
-- If user asks 'what is my next available slot', search_availability should be true.",
         "required": false
      }
   }
}
```
